WEBVTT

00:00:04.030 --> 00:00:06.190
Hey, Asahi, let's go home.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:09.680
What's wrong?

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:11.960
You seem bummed out lately.

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:15.080
Oh... Nah, it's nothing.

00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:17.870
Did Shiragami-san dump you?

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:19.410
<b>Did she dump you?</b>

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:23.040
You're so obvious.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:58.010
<b>Let's Stop This
Confession!</b>

00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:57.650
Let's Stop This Confession!

00:01:59.130 --> 00:02:00.590
Well, actually,

00:02:00.880 --> 00:02:04.350
Shiragami's been acting kinda cold lately.

00:02:05.320 --> 00:02:06.890
Translated, this becomes

00:02:07.280 --> 00:02:11.890
"love is more afraid of 
change than destruction."

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:17.610
Um, Shiragami?

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:19.740
This DVD you lent me...

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:21.540
It was really good.

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:23.060
Y-Yeah?

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:25.900
That's good to hear, sir.

00:02:25.900 --> 00:02:27.200
"Sir"?!

00:02:29.660 --> 00:02:31.130
Shiragami?

00:02:31.350 --> 00:02:34.380
I... haven't had lunch yet.

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:37.720
So, um... Do you want to have lunch with me?

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:41.840
I'm not hungry right now.

00:02:43.710 --> 00:02:45.760
I'm going now. Goodbye.

00:02:51.700 --> 00:02:56.160
So I've ended up doing stuff 
like that to avoid Kuromine-kun.

00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:59.270
Seriously, what am I doing? I'm so stupid.

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:02.200
I see.

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:04.200
You're wearing white today.

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:06.930
Hey! You were listening to me?

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:09.040
In my own perverted way, of course.

00:03:10.260 --> 00:03:13.630
Well, all I can say is...

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:18.510
Be more honest with your own feelings.

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:21.140
Shiho...

00:03:25.740 --> 00:03:28.620
Wh-Wh-What are you doing, you idiot?!

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:34.730
Well, anyway...

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:38.760
Why don't you just go find Shiragami-san 
and walk home with her?

00:03:39.300 --> 00:03:40.120
But...

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:43.300
Don't worry. We'll be there, too.

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:45.940
If it turns out you've been 
dumped for good, we'll celebr—

00:03:45.940 --> 00:03:48.620
I mean, comfort you.

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:52.120
Shima, that's kind of brutal.

00:03:55.660 --> 00:03:56.640
<i>No.</i>

00:03:56.640 --> 00:03:57.960
<i>This is bad.</i>

00:03:58.170 --> 00:03:59.710
<i>Ever since that day,</i>

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:02.960
<i>Kuromine Asahi and 
Shiragami Youko's relationship</i>

00:04:02.960 --> 00:04:05.010
<i>has indeed become awkward.</i>

00:04:06.060 --> 00:04:08.260
<i>No, I must stay calm.</i>

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:11.560
<i>There's something more important right now.</i>

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:20.380
<i>Kuromine Asahi and Shiragami Youko may 
continue to grow distant at this rate.</i>

00:04:20.380 --> 00:04:24.360
<i>And I'd be the one to have parted them.</i>

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:26.790
I can't let that happen.

00:04:26.790 --> 00:04:29.600
I haven't been able to talk to them ever since.

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:30.790
I have to apologize.

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:33.160
I have to apologize to 
them properly, in person.

00:04:34.470 --> 00:04:37.440
Ah, youth! Eh, Aizawa Nagisa?

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:39.420
You're...

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:41.070
The horned girl!

00:04:42.930 --> 00:04:44.360
Just what do you want?

00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:48.840
Oh, I just thought I'd have a 
listen to your inner voice.

00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:49.600
What?

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:54.450
"All the better if those two have a falling-out."

00:04:54.450 --> 00:04:58.110
"I'd have one less romantic rival."

00:04:58.110 --> 00:04:59.630
That's nonsense!

00:04:59.630 --> 00:05:02.480
Who would think such devilish thoughts?

00:05:03.260 --> 00:05:04.990
Have you forgotten?

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:08.530
I'm a devil who has lived for thousands of years.

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:10.620
I can grant people their wishes.

00:05:11.270 --> 00:05:19.110
I'd be willing to grant you your 
wish for happiness, at a price.

00:05:22.510 --> 00:05:26.550
Publish this in the school 
newspaper, and it's over.

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:28.590
H-How did you get that?!

00:05:29.920 --> 00:05:32.230
My eyes see all!

00:05:30.650 --> 00:05:32.210
Stop! Stop right there!

00:05:32.210 --> 00:05:34.600
What fool would stop after being told to?

00:05:34.920 --> 00:05:36.850
Stop, please, Principal.

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:38.870
Wh-What are you doing? Unhand me!

00:05:38.870 --> 00:05:42.030
You're ruining my chance to 
eat Aizawa's handmade cake!

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:43.230
Koumoto-sensei.

00:05:43.560 --> 00:05:45.570
What say you quit messing with the students

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:47.150
and get back to work?

00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:49.650
This is part of my work as a principal!

00:05:49.650 --> 00:05:51.700
It's emotional care for troubled youth!

00:05:52.070 --> 00:05:57.130
I spend every day troubled by the repair 
fees after you destroyed my apartment!

00:05:52.470 --> 00:05:57.130
Stop! Stop it!

00:05:57.130 --> 00:05:59.960
How about emotional care for your 
great-great-granddaughter, damn it?!

00:06:04.320 --> 00:06:07.930
Now, let's work like a workhorse, shall we?

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:10.360
Hustle, Principal.

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:12.390
What's with that wooden sword?

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:16.360
That horned girl is... the principal?

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:18.640
Oh, right.

00:06:19.430 --> 00:06:21.440
I have to dispose of this dangerous item.

00:06:25.590 --> 00:06:30.030
Actually, if it's only for personal use,
it should be fine, right?

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:31.680
Yes, that's it!

00:06:31.680 --> 00:06:34.480
I'll take it home and do that "lamination" thing...

00:06:34.480 --> 00:06:35.730
Class Rep?

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:39.290
Wh-What is it, Kuromine Asahi?

00:06:39.600 --> 00:06:41.630
What about you? What are you doing?

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:43.900
<i>Of all times...</i>

00:06:43.900 --> 00:06:45.090
Oh?

00:06:45.310 --> 00:06:47.510
It's Aizawa-san and Asahi and his buddies.

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:49.510
Wha— Akemi Mikan?!

00:06:52.740 --> 00:06:54.300
You just hid something, didn't you?

00:06:54.300 --> 00:06:55.110
No!

00:06:55.110 --> 00:06:56.670
Me? The class rep?

00:06:56.670 --> 00:06:58.810
What could I possibly have to hide?

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:01.510
Let me see, then!

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:03.680
A picture?

00:07:03.680 --> 00:07:05.650
What's it a picture of?

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:07.070
Don't look!

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:12.990
Wh-What is this picture, Class Rep?!

00:07:13.880 --> 00:07:14.660
Don't look!

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:18.910
Where'd you even pull that ice cream from?!

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:20.460
Y-You've got it all wrong!

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:21.800
This photo is...

00:07:21.800 --> 00:07:23.380
Wait, photo?

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:25.790
What are you guys talking about?

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:27.800
Where is this photo you speak of?

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:29.880
There is no such thing!

00:07:34.400 --> 00:07:35.760
She swallowed it!

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:37.720
There, now I'm—

00:07:38.970 --> 00:07:40.480
Class Rep...

00:07:40.720 --> 00:07:42.100
I can't see.

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:44.760
Kuromine-kun?

00:07:46.260 --> 00:07:48.680
Shiragami Youko...

00:07:56.360 --> 00:08:00.040
Um, I thought we could walk home together,

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:01.530
but yeah, of course.

00:08:01.530 --> 00:08:05.100
You're going to walk home with Aizawa-san, right?

00:08:05.680 --> 00:08:07.980
W-Wait, Shiragami Youko!

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:09.980
Shiragami!

00:08:25.680 --> 00:08:27.480
<i>What am I...</i>

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:36.660
<i>What am I supposed to do?</i>

00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:40.660
Be more honest with your own feelings.

00:08:45.720 --> 00:08:50.580
Be honest with my own feelings, huh?

00:08:56.130 --> 00:08:59.050
<b>Dad</b>

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:03.060
<b>Damn that Akari,
always getting
in my way...</b>

00:09:06.920 --> 00:09:09.520
Um... What did you want to talk about?

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:14.740
Well, there's something 
I want to tell you today.

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:18.370
Thanks for everything.

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:23.640
You protected my secret that I'm a vampire,

00:09:23.640 --> 00:09:25.720
and you were my friend.

00:09:25.720 --> 00:09:27.190
Really, thank you.

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:30.130
Where's all this coming from, Shiragami?

00:09:30.360 --> 00:09:31.320
But...

00:09:31.760 --> 00:09:33.260
Now it's goodbye.

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:38.400
My dad found out.

00:09:38.400 --> 00:09:41.840
So I have to quit school and go back home.

00:09:41.840 --> 00:09:44.150
Wh-What are you talking about, Shiragami?

00:09:44.150 --> 00:09:46.470
Goodbye, Kuromine-kun.

00:09:46.470 --> 00:09:47.560
Hey, wait!

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:48.810
Shiragami!

00:09:53.380 --> 00:09:54.500
Just a dream...

00:09:57.140 --> 00:09:58.070
But...

00:10:03.800 --> 00:10:04.980
Shiragami!

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:10.720
Thank goodness.

00:10:10.720 --> 00:10:12.620
Wh-What's wrong?

00:10:13.370 --> 00:10:14.800
Nothing.

00:10:15.290 --> 00:10:17.160
I... I see.

00:10:23.580 --> 00:10:24.810
Morning.

00:10:25.440 --> 00:10:27.270
M-Morning.

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:29.520
Hey—

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:32.420
Hey, Asahi.

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:35.400
Kuromine-kun,

00:10:35.810 --> 00:10:37.880
there's something I want to tell you.

00:10:37.880 --> 00:10:39.910
I'll be waiting on the rooftop after school.

00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:42.660
Shiragami...

00:10:42.840 --> 00:10:45.430
Huh? What's up with Shiragami-san?

00:10:46.680 --> 00:10:48.790
Shiragami-san asked you to meet her?

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:53.040
S-Seriously, Asahi?!

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:54.460
Y-Yeah.

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:56.340
Doesn't that mean she's gonna confess?!

00:10:56.550 --> 00:10:58.310
Hey! Keep it down!

00:10:58.750 --> 00:11:00.880
So, what are you going to do, Asahi?

00:11:00.880 --> 00:11:03.280
I-I'm going, of course.

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:04.570
What about the class rep?

00:11:04.570 --> 00:11:06.100
Gonna date both of them?

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:08.660
I told you yesterday...

00:11:08.660 --> 00:11:10.790
That stuff with the class rep 
is a misunderstanding.

00:11:10.790 --> 00:11:12.810
There's nothing between us.

00:11:13.720 --> 00:11:16.080
I have to tell Shiragami that, too.

00:11:16.080 --> 00:11:17.910
Is it really going to work out that well?

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:20.030
Hypothetically,

00:11:20.030 --> 00:11:23.480
what if Shiragami-san's going 
to confess the opposite?

00:11:23.480 --> 00:11:24.570
The opposite?

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:28.920
If Shiragami-san, having misinterpreted 
your relationship with the class rep,

00:11:28.920 --> 00:11:30.460
decided to do the right thing...

00:11:31.650 --> 00:11:32.830
Kuromine-kun,

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:34.700
I think...

00:11:34.700 --> 00:11:37.340
we shouldn't be friends anymore.

00:11:44.310 --> 00:11:46.490
What will you do if that happens?

00:11:46.490 --> 00:11:49.890
O-Obviously, I'd tell her that's not true.

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:53.200
I'd try to... clear it up...

00:11:57.390 --> 00:11:58.480
It's hopeless.

00:11:58.480 --> 00:11:59.560
He's screwed.

00:11:59.560 --> 00:12:01.610
This is going to be a whole new tragedy.

00:12:01.840 --> 00:12:02.620
Indeed.

00:12:03.080 --> 00:12:06.120
There's just one way to avoid that tragedy.

00:12:06.640 --> 00:12:08.120
Confess before you get dumped.

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:10.080
<b>Kill or</b>

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:11.100
<i>Confess before you get dumped?!</i>

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:11.100
<b>Kill or
be killed</b>

00:12:11.260 --> 00:12:13.130
Victory to the swift, huh?

00:12:13.130 --> 00:12:13.960
Exactly.

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:15.420
Go for it like a man.

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:17.040
B-But...

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:20.170
You have to tell her how 
you feel this time, Asahi.

00:12:21.480 --> 00:12:22.800
You guys...

00:12:28.110 --> 00:12:30.840
Didn't something like this happen before?

00:12:32.490 --> 00:12:34.190
Okay, I get it.

00:12:34.360 --> 00:12:37.420
I'll go talk to Shiragami after school today.

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:41.900
You think he'll be okay?

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:43.820
It might actually work out.

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:46.460
Asahi's a leaky basket, after all.

00:12:46.460 --> 00:12:52.290
Shiragami-san might understand his true 
feelings if he just tells her straight-up.

00:12:53.210 --> 00:12:54.810
That makes sense.

00:12:57.770 --> 00:12:58.790
<i>Shoot.</i>

00:13:00.140 --> 00:13:01.310
<i>This is a coincidence.</i>

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:04.120
<i>This is nothing but a coincidence.</i>

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:06.360
<i>But...</i>

00:13:07.160 --> 00:13:09.340
That stuff with the class rep 
is a misunderstanding.

00:13:09.340 --> 00:13:11.430
There's nothing between us.

00:13:12.620 --> 00:13:16.200
Kuromine Asahi, confessing to Shiragami Youko?

00:13:16.200 --> 00:13:17.560
There's no way he can do it.

00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:19.320
He'll pull it off.

00:13:20.020 --> 00:13:21.000
Akemi Mikan!

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:22.540
You were eavesdropping? You coward!

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:24.330
You're one to talk.

00:13:25.190 --> 00:13:25.960
Well,

00:13:25.960 --> 00:13:30.490
I think I've got the gist of the situation,
having been watching since the festival.

00:13:30.790 --> 00:13:33.370
You like Asahi, don't you?

00:13:34.470 --> 00:13:36.560
Wh-What nonsense is that?!

00:13:36.560 --> 00:13:38.830
I wouldn't engage in something so frivolous!

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:41.390
You're an open book, too, aren't you?

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:43.040
Okay, fine.

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:46.430
I'll give you a warning, 
as his childhood friend.

00:13:46.430 --> 00:13:47.340
A warning?

00:13:47.910 --> 00:13:49.490
Asahi's always been

00:13:49.490 --> 00:13:54.100
a wuss who can't even talk 
properly with the girls he likes.

00:13:54.890 --> 00:13:58.580
But still, he'd try to confess 
in his own wussy way.

00:13:59.030 --> 00:14:02.360
And he'd get rejected, cry, and get depressed,

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:04.640
but still try hard in his wussy way.

00:14:05.340 --> 00:14:07.940
And then he'd end up liking someone else.

00:14:10.940 --> 00:14:14.600
I have to give him credit for his resilience.

00:14:15.340 --> 00:14:17.440
I could never do that.

00:14:17.910 --> 00:14:23.220
Anyway, Shiragami-san is his first serious love.

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:25.100
So he might actually

00:14:25.100 --> 00:14:28.310
have the momentum to pull off his confession.

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:34.100
I think you should come up with 
an answer before you regret it.

00:14:35.800 --> 00:14:38.060
Regret, huh?

00:14:38.890 --> 00:14:39.770
What...

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:42.950
What am I supposed to do?

00:14:48.750 --> 00:14:51.320
Th-Thank you, Akemi Mikan.

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:53.870
You've given me a chance 
to re-evaluate myself

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:55.980
and what I need to do.

00:14:58.400 --> 00:15:00.440
This is going to get interesting.

00:15:00.440 --> 00:15:03.260
Mikan-san, what about yourself?

00:15:03.260 --> 00:15:05.220
Oh, you shut up.

00:15:05.220 --> 00:15:09.210
Since when do you get to order me around?

00:15:07.990 --> 00:15:10.510
Ouch, ouch! That hurts!

00:15:13.460 --> 00:15:15.420
I'm just me.

00:15:24.870 --> 00:15:26.870
<i>I'll give Shiragami this love letter</i>

00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:30.080
<i>and tell her how I feel.</i>

00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:33.660
<i>This letter I've kept in my bag ever since</i>

00:15:34.170 --> 00:15:37.370
<i>that day I tried and failed to confess to her...</i>

00:15:38.300 --> 00:15:40.340
<i>It's finally time to give it to her.</i>

00:15:41.900 --> 00:15:42.920
<i>Stay calm.</i>

00:15:43.390 --> 00:15:44.580
<i>Stay calm, me.</i>

00:15:45.730 --> 00:15:48.180
<i>Once I go up these stairs
and onto the rooftop...</i>

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:49.970
That's as far as you go.

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:54.010
I apologize, Kuromine Asahi,

00:15:54.010 --> 00:15:55.470
but you shall not pass.

00:15:58.900 --> 00:16:02.520
For the many troubles I've caused you 
since the day of the summer festival,

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:04.150
I truly apologize.

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:06.350
However...

00:16:06.350 --> 00:16:09.430
I've been thinking things over since then,

00:16:09.430 --> 00:16:11.400
and I've arrived at a conclusion.

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:15.490
I must...

00:16:16.680 --> 00:16:19.120
do everything I can to incapacitate you!

00:16:19.400 --> 00:16:21.560
Wh-What are you saying, Class Rep?!

00:16:21.560 --> 00:16:22.830
No arguments!

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:28.720
What the...

00:16:28.720 --> 00:16:29.340
A shovel?!

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:32.100
Not to worry. This is not a shovel.

00:16:32.100 --> 00:16:34.760
It's a cutting-edge sleep induction 
device from my planet.

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:37.260
The harder the contact made with the tip,

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:39.840
the deeper the sleep it induces.

00:16:39.840 --> 00:16:43.350
In other words, you plan to whack me 
unconscious with a shovel, right?!

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:44.390
N-No!

00:16:45.340 --> 00:16:46.770
It <i>is</i> a shovel!

00:16:46.970 --> 00:16:48.270
It's a sleep induction device!

00:16:51.100 --> 00:16:52.240
Damn it!

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:56.200
Why is the class rep trying to kill me?!

00:16:56.540 --> 00:16:57.730
Stop!

00:16:58.530 --> 00:17:00.330
What's gotten into you, anyway?

00:17:00.640 --> 00:17:02.250
Tell me what's going on!

00:17:03.360 --> 00:17:04.870
W-Well...

00:17:05.470 --> 00:17:07.380
<i>Yes, I know.</i>

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:10.710
<i>What I'm doing is awful.</i>

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:14.420
<i>I'm trying to stop your confession.</i>

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:22.710
<i>If you confess to her,</i>

00:17:22.710 --> 00:17:25.230
<i>you will most likely become a couple.</i>

00:17:25.700 --> 00:17:27.810
<i>I thought I understood that.</i>

00:17:28.870 --> 00:17:31.810
<i>So I need only support the two of you.</i>

00:17:32.660 --> 00:17:36.630
<i>I need only give you both my blessing.</i>

00:17:37.470 --> 00:17:39.660
<i>But if I did that...</i>

00:17:40.570 --> 00:17:43.000
<i>We couldn't be together.</i>

00:17:44.900 --> 00:17:47.370
<i>I love you, Kuromine Asahi.</i>

00:17:48.320 --> 00:17:51.880
<i>You were the first one on this 
planet to learn I was an alien,</i>

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:54.960
<i>and yet you accepted me, 
and for that, I love you.</i>

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:56.970
<i>And you,</i>

00:17:57.440 --> 00:17:59.260
<i>Shiragami Youko, for accepting me</i>

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:02.440
<i>in the same way and becoming my friend...</i>

00:18:02.440 --> 00:18:04.170
<i>I love you just about as much.</i>

00:18:06.140 --> 00:18:07.260
<i>Right.</i>

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:09.320
<i>That's right.</i>

00:18:10.950 --> 00:18:13.530
<i>That's why I don't want this to happen.</i>

00:18:14.490 --> 00:18:17.010
<i>Whether you confess to Shiragami Youko</i>

00:18:17.390 --> 00:18:19.530
<i>or I confess to you,</i>

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:22.330
<i>the relationship I have with you two now...</i>

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:25.360
<i>Not that.</i>

00:18:25.790 --> 00:18:27.290
<i>Anything but that!</i>

00:18:43.130 --> 00:18:45.390
Please stop, Class Rep.

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:46.930
I don't understand!

00:18:48.560 --> 00:18:50.810
I don't understand, either!

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:54.090
No matter how much I think about it,

00:18:54.090 --> 00:18:56.440
I don't know what to do.

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:57.190
That's why...

00:18:58.340 --> 00:19:00.630
Right now, this is...

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:03.370
This is my only option!

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:05.120
What are you even talking about?

00:19:05.380 --> 00:19:07.320
As convenient as it is,

00:19:07.320 --> 00:19:09.450
as selfish as it is...

00:19:09.450 --> 00:19:11.880
Still... Still, I...

00:19:12.180 --> 00:19:14.880
I can't let you confess!

00:19:15.710 --> 00:19:16.820
Class Rep...

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:31.230
What the hell is this?!

00:19:32.530 --> 00:19:35.560
What happened to Kuromine-kun?

00:19:38.100 --> 00:19:40.340
It's blocked off completely.

00:19:40.340 --> 00:19:42.340
Prepare yourself, Kuromine Asahi.

00:19:43.830 --> 00:19:47.480
Class Rep, what's all this about 
stopping my confession?

00:19:47.480 --> 00:19:48.930
W-Well—

00:19:48.930 --> 00:19:51.040
Just tell me why you're doing this.

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:57.380
If I could tell you that, 
none of this would be so hard!

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:01.710
If I could tell you...

00:20:04.140 --> 00:20:05.480
<i>Class Rep...</i>

00:20:13.140 --> 00:20:14.650
Sorry, Class Rep.

00:20:20.840 --> 00:20:24.610
<i>I don't know why you're trying to stop me</i>

00:20:24.840 --> 00:20:26.620
<i>from confessing to her,</i>

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:30.790
<i>but she's waiting for me on 
the other side of the door.</i>

00:20:33.180 --> 00:20:33.920
The one...

00:20:34.910 --> 00:20:36.040
The one...

00:20:37.420 --> 00:20:38.630
The one I love!

00:20:40.420 --> 00:20:41.510
Shiragami!

00:20:46.470 --> 00:20:47.870
Kuromine-kun...

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:53.310
Shiragami!

00:20:56.220 --> 00:20:58.690
Sorry, Kuromine-kun.

00:21:15.310 --> 00:21:18.570
<i>That's when I realized.</i>

00:21:19.190 --> 00:21:21.820
<i>Shiragami wasn't waiting on the rooftop</i>

00:21:21.820 --> 00:21:24.590
<i>for any kind of confession.</i>

00:21:25.080 --> 00:21:27.080
<i>Like in the nightmare I had that morning,</i>

00:21:27.080 --> 00:21:30.430
<i>she was being taken home 
because her secret got out,</i>

00:21:31.490 --> 00:21:33.680
<i>and she wanted to say goodbye.</i>

00:21:34.440 --> 00:21:37.270
K-Kuromine Asahi...

00:21:38.680 --> 00:21:40.490
Please, Class Rep.

00:21:40.490 --> 00:21:42.000
Help me out.

00:21:44.980 --> 00:21:46.740
I'm going to

00:21:48.290 --> 00:21:49.840
get Shiragami back.

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:24.790
<b>The last <i>Actually I Am</i> Quiz!</b>

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:24.790
<b>Can you guess?</b>

00:23:21.590 --> 00:23:23.060
The last <i>Actually I Am</i> Quiz!

00:23:23.060 --> 00:23:24.790
What will happen in the last episode?

00:23:24.790 --> 00:23:27.010
We'll chase Shiragami Youko 
into the depths of space.

00:23:27.010 --> 00:23:28.010
That's way too grandiose!

00:23:28.010 --> 00:23:31.470
In the end, my ____ is going to ____.

00:23:31.470 --> 00:23:32.970
What's this white light?

00:23:32.970 --> 00:23:35.640
Mikan-san's going to form a pact 
with me and become a magic girl.

00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:36.810
Shut up, bigmouth glasses!

00:23:36.810 --> 00:23:39.240
A prince on a white horse will come for me.

00:23:39.240 --> 00:23:40.480
No way.

00:23:40.480 --> 00:23:41.850
A-Anyway, what's the answer?

00:23:41.850 --> 00:23:44.850
The answer is: I'm going to fight 
my dad for world domination.

00:23:44.850 --> 00:23:46.740
Have you forgotten this is a romantic comedy?!

00:23:46.740 --> 00:23:49.960
S-See the answer in next week's <i>Actually, I Am!</i>

00:23:47.070 --> 00:23:51.070
<b>Next Episode:
"Let's Go Home Together!"</b>
